      "value": "Relevant reports from Asian players:\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/frequent-timeouts\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/game-softlocks-when-joining-instances\n\nI'm from Russia, but I live in the Asian part (Far East), close to Japan. Could be an Asia-related issue?",
