  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Almost every time I join a world I get the error message: \"Your connection to VRChat timed out. Verify Connection and try again\". I press OK, the game tries again, and usually gets in on the second attempt. But sometimes it can take up to 4 attempts.\n\nOccasionally I get this error while already in a world as well - in this case my friends will see me frozen for about 10 seconds, but I can still see them moving and hear them talking - until the error message pops up. \n\nThis started happening immediately since the drone update went live. I was using the beta earlier and had no issues there.\n\nExample log files:\n\noutput_log_2025-05-03_14-42-34.txt - timed-out while in Club Vudu, and then timed-out a couple times while in Deadlock Alley\n\noutput_log_2025-05-05_14-46-35.txt - club hopping, no time-outs while in worlds, but at least one time-out on every world change",
